3a3f74ae44e5125ef0cec11632a0386781f46 conan: Update expected results\n- cfa7928e47cb9f1f8ca6f9d8d3bddec2792953f6 crossd: Simplify the setups a bit\n- e5d25d940f27b5bc279297e41ec965af01371593 crossd: Use default criticality thresholds\n- b7eb75f192d889ebea7d7cef45c5ce52ec2c91b1 crossd: Use more concise test names\n- 1f12d690ef8d60ced0e99e7c1aa6859142c1740e cyclonedx: Fix formatting issues in expected results\n- 741d30376b8da30b725677c4ef84f48ae2df9c71 maven: Fixup expected results\n- 5fbf2f2805cbdd842c02f0715efed10eea8fa6a8 python: Update expected results\n- 0d54bb2da3fa90843f252598199eb3946dbfae5c python: Update expected results\n- bd6c43a8d97288b5647becc705c5b7b09c23ee41 spdx-expression: Align on using single char license IDs\n- b1d518bbcf77bed025303f4fc5524dcd2d9cce21 spdx-expression: Consistently uppercase single char license IDs\n- efe9c4eea69d17a72a466b8ac96953ff431a90be spdx-expression: Refer to the choice instead of to the user\n\n### 🐘 Build & ⚙️ CI\n- 95f1dec7189623eefb7cff61762b61306f6053ee gradle: Set `org.gradle.tooling.parallel` explicitly\n- 1f9ea8ef3715a2ba77fe7c7745c496512b867a39 Account for tomlkt library coordinates to have changed\n- 32de403460d0c561dbf5b43efd046af765378ec7 github: Remove Qodana checks\n\n### 📖 Documentation\n- 99dc80925c7337b458634ef18e64b9ec6c29d6e5 crossd: Fix a link to use Markdown syntax\n\n### 🔧 Chores\n- 3d842d7e233e9b199bd2e36d8c8a6b9b47b45ba9 crossd: Prefer `also` over `let` for an unused return value\n- 4106d0802b2c61a1d1747f9baabcee083d636abf evaluator: Exit more gracefully for unknown resources\n- 94041f6e95b3877bab6dc994449452fb5f810970 evaluator: Omit the superfluous `Default` JSON object\n- e44189ad32bcb7c23b7fa6f3a660191161e90392 gradle-inspector: Use `also` instead of `let` where possible\n- 4ae0d01d86278636934163c19687b52b668610bb spdx-expression: Improve replaceSubexpressionWithChoice() a bit\n- 90168490c0865c737ab8f41dbcfbf7113b5bfdf7 Wrap a few `getResource()` calls in `checkNotNull()`\n\n### 🚀 Dependency Updates\n- 27b2e67dc3a9f3d06c3d362ec205ee221ad53cc5 update actions/setup-java action to v6.2.0\n- e98e3e6726309c6dd3a702082ada8c9db134c2e1 update at.yawk.lz4:lz4-java to v1.13.0\n- 9fd0d6e76488d6fd166a629313c23020fd0a1bf7 update aws-java-sdk-v2 monorepo to v2.57.6\n- c007585cbcfc7592d02648a3f01c83a95182e7bc update com.github.jmongard.git-semver-plugin to v0.19.6\n- 7c606603256c6f26b75f63f2b7699efa3667967c update com.networknt:json-schema-validator to v3.0.9\n- f300f6ba860bd0146d85e710cf0b8e116009b2f5 update dependency getprovenant/provenant to v1.0.16\n- 11cb0ee8e741d96648181f2a5f7bee77f8eb9a61 update dev.aga.gradle.version-catalog-generator to v4.2.3\n- 12b0eaca2c7d01de6539d655e6b8dddb8a66edfe update exposed to v1.6.1\n- 21c775b998b56ede1eadcf049b5ae5b361c0650b update github/codeql-action action to v4.39.2\n- 96b7968923fad746a4f3713560bf72d026197533 update github/codeql-action action to v4.39.3\n- 8c238407197df1e94bbf1c41383e583c55e7b850 update io.ktor:ktor-version-catalog to v3.6.1\n- fc8e04207c618f83dc234330379780786528d008 update jdx/mise-action action to v5.2.5\n- c3e8f1b2aea555fde9dd445aedd069fd632a58f9 update jdx/mise-action action to v5.2.6\n- 8e5356b537aafb6c41a919bb6852cee77c73298a update jgit to v7.8.1.202611041320-r\n- a189c1d0674a52d2a103c65dd26105abe1f796c6 update ksp monorepo to v2.3.13\n- 9a02ff6dcee23f922223b43199a0759b07f7bb9f update mordant to v3.1.1\n- 204b6a61736bd7e5f77fc53c13850ebd7d8eb5dc update org.apache.tika:tika-core to v4.2.0\n- 22847a6498306d7ee8bc0812529cc0c453a1f3e6 update org.graalvm.buildtools:native-gradle-plugin to v1.1.18\n\n### 💡 Other Changes\n- 6c5c307887e8d3b6c8c2c2b751e4d4eda8822d73 Revert \"deps: update ksp monorepo to v2.3.13\"\n\n\n\n"}